1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:04,900
A criminal network rarely appears in a single file.

2
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:09,166
It appears in fragments.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,868
A name, a phone number, an account, a location.

4
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,750
The evidence is there.

5
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,918
But the connection can stay buried.

6
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:29,918
And as records multiply, manual review becomes slower... and harder to scale.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,616
So, what if every fragment could become part of one connected investigation?

8
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,994
This is Network Intel.

9
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:55,720
It turns supported investigation records into entities an investigator can work with.

10
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:02,968
People, phones, accounts, vehicles, and locations, all connected to their source.

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,824
The same person may appear differently across different records.

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,408
Network Intel proposes a possible match, then leaves the decision with the investigator.

13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:26,656
Now, those scattered relationships begin to form a network.

14
00:01:27,450 --> 00:01:34,722
People, devices, and accounts can be explored together, without losing the evidence behind them.

15
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,928
Here is the question that matters.

16
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:49,820
How are Rahul Sharma and Vikram Singh connected?

17
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:54,078
Network Intel traces the graph.

18
00:01:55,900 --> 00:02:00,796
One sourced step at a time... a six-hop association emerges.

19
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,880
And this is where trust matters.

20
00:02:08,900 --> 00:02:12,620
Investigations can't depend on a black box.

21
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,368
Open the lead, and the path returns to evidence.

22
00:02:19,550 --> 00:02:25,910
The exact file, row, timestamp, verification status, and original excerpt.

23
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,256
The system surfaces the connection. The evidence supports review.

24
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:35,996
But the investigator remains the final authority.

25
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,808
Less manual cross-referencing.

26
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:48,038
Non-obvious paths, made visible.

27
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,808
The evidence may already be there.

28
00:02:51,950 --> 00:02:54,830
Network Intel reveals the connection.